It is Sunday.
I wake up late.
My flat is quiet.
I make my breakfast.
The coffee is hot.
There is also a bread roll.
I eat at the table.
My phone is lying here.
I look at the time.
It is eleven o'clock in Berlin.
My family is in Mexico.
It is three o'clock at night there.
My mother and my father are still sleeping.
The video call is in the afternoon.
Who is on the call today?
My parents, my brother Diego, and my sister Sofia.
I still have a little time.
I will show something from Berlin later.
I need German chocolate for the video.
I drink my coffee and then go outside.
